  speakerName: LOLA BEBANG
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Questions help us learn about the world around us.


    In Ilokano,
    ''ania'' means ''what.''


    Use it when asking about an object, thing, or
    information.


    Listen carefully: ania.


    Now, try saying ''ania'' yourself.'
